        <mxCell id="23hkRLPfUXfo8b9_7GuW-10" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#ffcd28;gradientColor=#ffa500;strokeColor=#d79b00;" value="&lt;p data-start=&quot;893&quot; data-end=&quot;917&quot; class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;893&quot; data-end=&quot;917&quot;&gt;2.1 Existing Network&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;918&quot; data-end=&quot;956&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;w9a87g&quot; data-start=&quot;918&quot; data-end=&quot;956&quot;&gt;2,800 charging stations across India&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;958&quot; data-end=&quot;981&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;958&quot; data-end=&quot;981&quot;&gt;2.2 Low Utilization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;982&quot; data-end=&quot;1023&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wxvvg6&quot; data-start=&quot;982&quot; data-end=&quot;1023&quot;&gt;Average network utilization is only 46%&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1025&quot; data-end=&quot;1049&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1025&quot; data-end=&quot;1049&quot;&gt;2.3 Urban Congestion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1050&quot; data-end=&quot;1110&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mw6ybc&quot; data-start=&quot;1050&quot; data-end=&quot;1110&quot;&gt;High-demand metro locations experience frequent congestion&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1112&quot; data-end=&quot;1146&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1112&quot; data-end=&quot;1146&quot;&gt;2.4 Underutilization Elsewhere&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1147&quot; data-end=&quot;1217&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qc91x5&quot; data-start=&quot;1147&quot; data-end=&quot;1217&quot;&gt;Highway and semi-urban stations operate significantly below capacity&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1219&quot; data-end=&quot;1247&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1219&quot; data-end=&quot;1247&quot;&gt;2.